{
  "about": "Merge rules shared by the server (internal/sync) and the app (app/src/lib/local/merge.ts). Both test suites run every case: start from row (null = the row does not exist), apply changes in order, compare with want. fields holds scalar columns, field_hlc their stamps, sets the set columns (row: stored OR-Set, want: visible elements, sorted). want.tags, where given, is the exact stored OR-Set.",
